<title>USA: Sunbeam grants employees stock options.</title>
<headline>Sunbeam grants employees stock options.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunbeam Corp said on Tuesday it granted stock options to its domestic workforce last week, making them all shareholders of the company.</p>
<p>The extended program granted options to about 2,500 employees who had not previously participated.</p>
<p>&quot;Each individual within our organization is now motivated from an ownership perspective,&quot; said Al Dunlap, chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>&quot;I am a firm believer in creating incentives for employees through stock options. The Sunbeam program allows them to share in the wealth they create for the shareholders,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
